<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: Whelingnorther Alliance -->
  <WNAMod>威灵诺德联合会</WNAMod>
  <!-- EN: Enable ideology conflict and hostility. When colony ideo contains some certain meme or precept, Whelingnorther Alliance will turn hostile. \n\n(Disabled by default) -->
  <WNAMod_enableIdeoConflictHostility>启用文化冲突敌对选项。当殖民地文化包含一些特定的戒律时，威灵会将转为敌对。\n\n（默认关闭）</WNAMod_enableIdeoConflictHostility>
  <!-- EN: Enable Permaconst reinforcement: When a pawn enthralled by Permaconst Command dies, there is a chance (7% by default) that they will immediately summon a "Hunting Cluster" raid. \n\n(Disabled by default) -->
  <WNAMod_enablePermaconstDeathAid>启用恒固指令增援：当一个被恒固指令仪式的小人被击杀时，有一定几率立刻生成一次“游猎集群”袭击。\n\n（默认关闭）</WNAMod_enablePermaconstDeathAid>
  <!-- EN: Reinforcement chance -->
  <WNAMod_permaconstDeathAidChance>增援概率（默认为7%）</WNAMod_permaconstDeathAidChance>
  <!-- EN: Revive destroyed settlements on Permaconst maintenance -->
  <WNAMod_reviveDestroyedSettlements>在恒固指令维护循环开始时复活被毁的定居点</WNAMod_reviveDestroyedSettlements>
  <!-- EN: When the Permaconst maintenance event fires, every destroyed settlement (including orbital platforms) is revived as a Permaconst Command outpost with an active defense grid. A ruin has a chance (7% by default) of being restored as a Whelingnorther Alliance settlement instead. Ruins that RimWorld is about to erase from the world map are converted the same way. Outposts are not destroyed settlements, so ruin cleanup - including the expiry timers other mods add - leaves them alone; should one be removed anyway, its tile becomes a Whelingnorther Alliance settlement.\n\n(Disabled by default) -->
  <WNAMod_reviveDestroyedSettlementsDesc>当恒固指令的维护循环开启时，所有被摧毁的定居点将被恒固指令接管。威灵诺德联合会也有一定概率接管某处被摧毁的定居点。</WNAMod_reviveDestroyedSettlementsDesc>
  <!-- EN: Whelingnorther Alliance chance -->
  <WNAMod_capturedSettlementWNAChance>威灵会接管定居点概率</WNAMod_capturedSettlementWNAChance>
  <!-- EN: Enable dead zone radiation spread: When a pawn carrying a certain radiation hediff dies, there will be an explosion and radiation zone will be spreaded.\n\n(Disabled by default) -->
  <WNAMod_enablePawnSpreadRadWhenKilled>启用辐射场扩散：携带某些辐射hediff的pawn死亡时，会产生辐射爆炸并扩散辐射场。\n\n（默认关闭）</WNAMod_enablePawnSpreadRadWhenKilled>
  <!-- EN: Max Returned Pawns -->
  <WNAMod_pawnReturnerMaxLimit>归返人数上限</WNAMod_pawnReturnerMaxLimit>
  <!-- EN: Maximum number of Whelingnorther Alliance pawns re-spawned onto the map at once while the Permaconst Command condition is active. -->
  <WNAMod_pawnReturnerMaxLimitDesc>恒固指令维护循环开启时，被持续送回地图的人员数目上限。</WNAMod_pawnReturnerMaxLimitDesc>
  <!-- EN: Return recency window (days) -->
  <WNAMod_pawnReturnerRecencyDays>归返窗口</WNAMod_pawnReturnerRecencyDays>
  <!-- EN: While the Permaconst Command condition is active, only pawns that left a map within this many days are resurrected and returned to it. Pawns off any map for longer than this are left alone. 2.357 days by default. -->
  <WNAMod_pawnReturnerRecencyDaysDesc>恒固指令维护循环开启时，距离上次出现在地图上的时间不足该窗口期的小人将被送回地图。默认值为2.357天。</WNAMod_pawnReturnerRecencyDaysDesc>
  <!-- EN: Spawn uplifted pawns at the ritual target -->
  <WNAMod_upliftSpawnAtRitualTarget>将升变小人放置于仪式点处\n\n（默认关闭）</WNAMod_upliftSpawnAtRitualTarget>
  <!-- EN: If enabled, the pawn created by the uplifting rite appears near the altar or ritual spot. If disabled, it appears where the subject was. Disabled by default. -->
  <WNAMod_upliftSpawnAtRitualTargetDesc>由“授权擢升”仪式产生的小人将在仪式点处出现，而非原目标所在位置。</WNAMod_upliftSpawnAtRitualTargetDesc>
  <!-- EN: Settlement auto-defense system -->
  <WNAMod_autoDefenseMaster>启用定居点自动防御系统\n\n&lt;color=#FF0000&gt;（默认开启！）&lt;/color&gt;</WNAMod_autoDefenseMaster>
  <!-- EN: Enable the automatic defense system of Whelingnorther Alliance settlements. Hostile world objects within range are engaged with defense missiles, and nearby transport pods or shuttles are destroyed on sight. Enabled by default. -->
  <WNAMod_autoDefenseMasterDesc>允许威灵诺德联合会和恒固指令在其定居点处部署自动防御系统。自动防御系统将自动攻击一定范围内的敌对世界目标。</WNAMod_autoDefenseMasterDesc>
  <!-- EN: Cross-layer defense -->
  <WNAMod_autoDefenseCrossLayer>启用立体防御\n\n（默认关闭）</WNAMod_autoDefenseCrossLayer>
  <!-- EN: If enabled, settlements also engage hostile targets on other planet layers (for example, orbital settlements firing at surface targets). Disabled by default. -->
  <WNAMod_autoDefenseCrossLayerDesc>自动防御系统将无视层级限制索敌（比如，从轨道层攻击地表层的敌对世界目标）。</WNAMod_autoDefenseCrossLayerDesc>
  <!-- EN: Attack sites and gravships -->
  <WNAMod_autoDefenseSitesGravships>允许攻击任务地点和逆重飞船\n\n（默认关闭）</WNAMod_autoDefenseSitesGravships>
  <!-- EN: <color=#ff6666>Warning: this may cause unexpected bugs.</color>\n\nIn addition to settlements and caravans, also attack hostile sites and gravships in flight. Sites often belong to quests or special incidents, and gravships may carry the player's own colonists. Enable at your own risk. Disabled by default. -->
  <WNAMod_autoDefenseSitesGravshipsDesc>&lt;color=#FF6666&gt;警告：开启该选项可能导致意料外的行为和错误。&lt;/color&gt;\n\n允许自动防御系统攻击归属于敌对目标的任务地点和逆重飞船。开启该选项之前，请确保您已经知晓可能存在的风险。</WNAMod_autoDefenseSitesGravshipsDesc>
  <!-- EN: Attack world objects that already have a map -->
  <WNAMod_autoDefenseGeneratedMaps>允许攻击已生成的地图\n\n（默认关闭）</WNAMod_autoDefenseGeneratedMaps>
  <!-- EN: <color=#ff6666>Warning: this may cause unexpected bugs.</color>\n\nIf enabled, a defense missile can strike a hostile world object whose map has already been generated. The missile detonates at the map center and the map is then removed. Surviving player colonists, prisoners and slaves are force-marched into a caravan together with the corpses of fallen colonists. Disabled by default. -->
  <WNAMod_autoDefenseGeneratedMapsDesc>&lt;color=#FF6666&gt;警告：开启该选项可能导致意料外的行为和错误。&lt;/color&gt;\n\n允许自动防御系统攻击已生成地图的世界目标，被打击的地图将被移除，幸存的殖民者、囚犯和奴隶将与殖民者尸体一同被强制转移至一枝远行队中。</WNAMod_autoDefenseGeneratedMapsDesc>
  <!-- EN: Battle units -->
  <WNA_BattleUnitsSection>战斗单位</WNA_BattleUnitsSection>
</LanguageData>